      "content": "It's a heavy feeling to carry when you feel trapped in a cycle you can't escape, but your body is designed to handle pain and change, even when it feels impossible right now. You are not just a passenger; you are the one holding the steering wheel, even if the road ahead feels dark and the engine is sputtering. Please don't let the weight of these patterns convince you to stop fighting, because your life has value beyond what your current pain can tell you.",
